            {
                "entry_id": "fd51888c-2f1a-39ab-81a4-510514695949",
                "word": "péréquation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d80230d0-d3f4-4af5-8b75-50d2a8dc5d99",
                        "entry_id": "fd51888c-2f1a-39ab-81a4-510514695949",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "péréquations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "65cad7e6-c801-3ded-87c5-88a846212f62",
                        "entry_id": "fd51888c-2f1a-39ab-81a4-510514695949",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Égalité, répartition égale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "772cd78a-83ae-4d39-a8f7-e7d4f5744a54",
                                "sense_id": "65cad7e6-c801-3ded-87c5-88a846212f62",
                                "text": "La péréquation de l’impôt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35244915-2ca9-4c4a-b9e2-617b83c6019e",
                                "sense_id": "65cad7e6-c801-3ded-87c5-88a846212f62",
                                "text": "La péréquation des traitements."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44427cc9-ade8-320d-a6a0-2f30fdf68bff",
                        "entry_id": "fd51888c-2f1a-39ab-81a4-510514695949",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Financement des activités déficitaires d’une entreprise ou d’une administration par les recettes perçues auprès d’autres clients ou usagers."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6578312-d553-4669-b956-7c0bd69d5ae7",
                                "sense_id": "44427cc9-ade8-320d-a6a0-2f30fdf68bff",
                                "text": "Pour la journaliste Isabelle Rey-Lefebvre, le projet Macron n’est pas seulement d’organiser une péréquation entre organismes riches et pauvres, mais surtout de les transformer tous en entreprises à structure capitalistique, avec des actionnaires."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47a72929-a81b-4c75-8614-8942470fc558",
                                "sense_id": "44427cc9-ade8-320d-a6a0-2f30fdf68bff",
                                "text": "Le ferroviaire coûte cher et sa rentabilité est inégale. Le service public permet d'y faire jouer le principe de péréquation : les lignes les plus rentables financent les moins rentables."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b4260507-dac6-32d8-8900-10e5ce5772e1",
                        "entry_id": "fd51888c-2f1a-39ab-81a4-510514695949",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Systèmes de transferts d’impôts entre les entités fédérées d’un État fédéral ou de redistribution du financement de l’État parmi des entités territoriales à l’intérieur d’un État unitaire"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9c25c6f-ab13-423a-aaff-9de5c612a218",
                                "sense_id": "b4260507-dac6-32d8-8900-10e5ce5772e1",
                                "text": "Le jeune patron du FDP, Christian Linder, qui réclame le poste de ministre des Finances, jusqu’alors dévolu à Wolfgang Schäuble, a déjà annoncé la couleur : pas de « budget de la zone euro qui contribuerait à une sorte de péréquation financière automatique en Europe »."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1de01abd-c01a-4a96-b826-6e74799d945d",
                                "sense_id": "b4260507-dac6-32d8-8900-10e5ce5772e1",
                                "text": "La péréquation est un programme administré par le gouvernement fédéral, qui prélève des impôts et taxes de tous les Canadiens et verse de l’argent aux provinces qui ont une moins grande capacité de générer des revenus, soit la \"capacité fiscale\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4bfe27a2-2948-4c0c-ac64-b0617bc31707",
                                "sense_id": "b4260507-dac6-32d8-8900-10e5ce5772e1",
                                "text": "L’accumulation des critères et l’émiettement des dotations et sous-dotations ne permettent plus de percevoir la direction principale de la péréquation, quand les choix devenus trop nombreux ne se neutralisent pas mutuellement."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fcf490db-c7f6-482c-85f2-55dfbdba144a",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd51888c-2f1a-39ab-81a4-510514695949",
                        "target_lang_word": "Finanzausgleich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "87ba54e6-6561-44f5-ab52-b4cfccac55f2",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd51888c-2f1a-39ab-81a4-510514695949",
                        "target_lang_word": "equalization payment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "equalization payment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e4f5d55-dcbb-399c-b89f-c0ab9fb62622",
                                        "entry_id": "a706675e-db19-35d3-a82b-89d6a04f5d43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extra money transferred from the federal government to a province, drawn from general tax revenue and intended to redistribute some wealth from relatively prosperous provinces to relatively poor provinces."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b39f44c0-dd96-4568-adc8-2d02ebbf1e9e",
                                                "sense_id": "0e4f5d55-dcbb-399c-b89f-c0ab9fb62622",
                                                "text": "Ontario may soon be classed as a \"have-not\" province and receive equalization payments for the first time in its history."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aae363be-e84b-4bf0-b6e4-3e26726e47e1",
                                                "sense_id": "0e4f5d55-dcbb-399c-b89f-c0ab9fb62622",
                                                "text": "Six “have-not” provinces are splitting $15.4 billion in equalization payments in 2012-13."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e708437e-18bd-45db-b3d8-a463c1ef2d53",
                                                "sense_id": "0e4f5d55-dcbb-399c-b89f-c0ab9fb62622",
                                                "text": "People whose provinces receive equalization payments are largely in denial about living in have-not regions, a poll suggests."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41671d0f-02d6-3cb1-af0e-75eeb33c4750",
                                        "entry_id": "a706675e-db19-35d3-a82b-89d6a04f5d43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a divorce agreement, a payment made by one spouse to the other in order to create an equal division of assets."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac1cd3f4-e2f4-4055-acb7-594306a4f221",
                                                "sense_id": "41671d0f-02d6-3cb1-af0e-75eeb33c4750",
                                                "text": "The court set aside a trial judge's decision from 2007 that required Harold Serra to make an \"equalization payment\" of $3.3 million to his former wife."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55a32fe9-ddcd-4fe4-8511-417ddbee23a8",
                                                "sense_id": "41671d0f-02d6-3cb1-af0e-75eeb33c4750",
                                                "text": "In places like Manitoba and Ontario, where the distribution of family assets upon marriage breakdown is done through an equalization payment based on the value of what both spouses’ own, the claim can be extinguished through a discharge from bankruptcy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86cd3a96-52bc-410a-86c0-c266ffad96fa",
                                                "sense_id": "41671d0f-02d6-3cb1-af0e-75eeb33c4750",
                                                "text": "[T]he impact of income taxes shapes the size and type of assets that are transferred between spouses. So, carefully consider them when splitting assets as part of an equalization payment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b57ec90-1ca7-4c51-b5bc-0f2440d4ff94",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd51888c-2f1a-39ab-81a4-510514695949",
